      322 -### Why tun2http Failed                                       
      323 -                                                              
      324 -The original tun2http implementation had a fundamental archite
          -ctural flaw:                                                  
      325 -- **HTTP (port 80)** requires: `GET http://example.com/path HT
          -TP/1.1` (direct proxy format)                                 
